            "notes": "\u2705: Keep [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124), [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48), [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f), [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e), [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f).\n\n\ud83d\udcb8: Buy [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca).\n\n\ud83d\udcdd: [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca) is picked and put into this build because it pairs with [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb) well. An optional is [Caduceus Ex](item_9e7965ea-2abc-44a7-b042-950c6ad2fce7).\n\n\ud83d\udcdd: [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) is good for this build because it's focusing on peeling for everyone and helping the whole team.\n\n\ud83d\udcdd: [Distortion](item_5557e2f2-02df-4eac-8128-0c23b71183b1) is an optional, because it pairs well with [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb).\n\n\ud83d\udcdd: [Renaissance](item_a460f234-6434-4d47-99f9-d4a0b15cd591) is an optional, because it pairs with [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb) and [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f).",
